<title>USA: IVC Industries Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>IVC Industries Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>FREEHOLD, N.J. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>IVC INDUSTRIES, INC</p>
<p> Quarter ended October 31,		  1996	   1995 (a)</p>
<p> Revenues			     $  31,563,000    $ 24,486,000</p>
<p>Operating Income before</p>
<p>Merger and Integration</p>
<p>    Costs				   1,883,000	 1,228,000</p>
<p> Merger and Integration Costs		  --	   156,000</p>
<p> Net Income			     870,000 (b)     579,000 (b)</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share			  0.05		0.03</p>
