<p>(a) -- Restated to reflect merger with Hall Laboratories Inc on a pooling of interests basis.</p>
<p>(b) -- Includes pretax merger and integration charges of $156,000 in 1995 relative to the merger with Hall Laboratories Inc on April 30, 1996.</p>
